"Esh is an Artonan on Earth and Lind's partner, with near-black hair braided to match hers."
"Esh observes Avowed training and asked the local Contract for every commended Avowed's profile."
"Esh told Lind a thirteen-year-old Ryeh-b't boy holds the highest commendation of any human."
"Esh's full name is Esh-erdi; he wears a translation device on Earth."
"During the Matadero attack Esh and Lind dropped among the fighters to finish the demon."
"Esh-erdi is a Knight of the Mother Planet, with close-set dark brown eyes and three long braids."
"He pulled Alden and Zeridee from the flood on a green nonagon platform steered by his rings."
"He is at odds with most healing spells and cannot cast pain relief."
"He calls himself a lifelong student of weak points and the way things fracture."
"He and Lind-otta are in esvulgivnas, an Artonan partnership celebration."
"He took Alden's testimony on the three dead burglars, believed him, and will handle Bash-nor."
"Earth news calls him General Esh-erdi, a general of the Mother Planet's anti-chaos force."
"He degraded the Submerger contaminant in the water Lind held still."
"After the flood he wore one ponytail in metal bands, many rings and a storage triangle on his belt."
"He studies preservation warps and affixation theory to find the origin of Alden's talent."
"He judges Joe selfish, reckless and arrogant, unforgivably so for a wizard his age."
"He sent a memo that Alden is his personal guest, not a servant or information source."
